      "top": 261.5753000000001,
      "x1": 567.0110000000001,
      "bottom": 271.5753000000001
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "may exert his Initiative. Denotes his overall presence on the",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 273.5753000000001,
      "x1": 566.8499999999998,
      "bottom": 283.5753
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "battlefield and the presence of his subordinates and aides as well",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 285.5753,
      "x1": 567.0029999999998,
      "bottom": 295.5753
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "as the effectiveness of his abilities.",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 297.5753,
      "x1": 454.235,
      "bottom": 307.5753
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "Elite Commander: This refers to leaders with a triangle symbol",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 314.9753,
      "x1": 567.1229999999998,
      "bottom": 324.9753
