      "column": "right",
      "text": "activation and the chances of that leader gaining a Momentum",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 368.3753,
      "x1": 567.004,
      "bottom": 378.3753
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "Orders Phase. It also defines the number of individual orders",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 380.3753,
      "x1": 567.0019999999998,
      "bottom": 390.3753
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "that leader may issue each Orders Phase. The higher the rating,",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 392.3753,
      "x1": 567.007,
      "bottom": 402.3753
