    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "the better the leader.",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 404.3753,
      "x1": 396.069,
      "bottom": 414.3753
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "Line Command: The boxed number to the right of the Initia-",
      "x0": 315.0,
      "top": 421.77529999999996,
      "x1": 567.0000000000001,
      "bottom": 431.77529999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "tive Rating indicates that the leader, instead of issuing a series",
      "x0": 315.00000000000006,
      "top": 433.77529999999996,
      "x1": 567.013,
      "bottom": 443.77529999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "of Individual Orders to a given number of units, may issue that",
      "x0": 315.00000000000006,
      "top": 445.77529999999996,
      "x1": 567.008,
      "bottom": 455.77529999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "number of Line Commands.",
      "x0": 315.00000000000006,
      "top": 457.77529999999996,
      "x1": 427.77000000000004,
      "bottom": 467.77529999999996
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "Strategy: For Overall Commanders only, facilitates the use of",
      "x0": 315.00000000000006,
      "top": 475.17529999999994,
      "x1": 566.9870000000001,
      "bottom": 485.17529999999994
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
