      "column": "right",
      "text": "DESIGN NOTE: This rating is usually quite low in SPQR.",
      "x0": 319.0,
      "top": 559.0787,
      "x1": 563.0,
      "bottom": 569.0787
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "Commanders of this era, except for the old-line Macedonians,",
      "x0": 319.0,
      "top": 571.0787,
      "x1": 562.999,
      "bottom": 581.0787
    },
    {
      "column": "right",
      "text": "had abandoned the up-front and personal style of hands-",
      "x0": 319.0,
